  booking_desc: "CyprusWay helps you find and compare hotels, rental cars, activities, and airport transfers. When you're ready to book, the app connects you to trusted travel providers where you complete your reservation. CyprusWay may earn a commission from bookings, at no extra cost to you. The providers handle your payment, booking confirmation, and customer service, CyprusWay helps you reach the right place with the right filters already applied.",
